{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42450","headline":"赠栖隐洞谭先生 · 孟贯","name":"赠栖隐洞谭先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生双鬓华，深谷卧云霞。\n不伐有巢树，多移无主花。\n石泉春酿酒，松火夜煎茶。\n因问山中事，如君有几家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟贯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}